      "value": "I am also running into this issue as well. I also hate the fact that I have to manually remove all members of my group before I can delete it. What if I have hundreds of members? Are you seriously going to ask me to go through the tedious process of manually removing each member before I am allowed to delete the group? Come on VRChat.",
