  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On the VRChat website, if you go to a group that you have moderation permissions in, and go to the members list, there is no edit button to kick/ban/edit roles for any members.\n\nSearching the members list still shows the edit button in search results.\n\nFirefox on Windows 11, tried on multiple PCs, no adblock.",
